                <p class="font-whimsy text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sky-accent">
                    ⏳ Save The Magical Date ⏳
                </p>
                <h2 class="font-serif-royal text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-navy-slate mt-1">
                    Countdown to Baby Yohanne's Baptism
                </h2>
                <p id="display-event-date-subtitle" class="font-whimsy text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-pink-deep mt-1">
                    Sunday, November 29, 2026 • 5:30 AM
